<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 17.7% in latest week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 17.7% in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK weekly department store sales rose 17.7 percent in the week to July 19 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 25 weeks to July 19, sales were up 10.6 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 8.7 percent in the latest week and 7.3 percent in the 25 week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
